    <dc:date>2023-12-27</dc:date>
    <rdf:value xml:lang="en">Renamed the datatype property (was 'source') and reduced its
               domain to Relation (the domain was the union of Record Resource and Relation).
               Consequently updated the rdfs:comment, labels and scope note. Added a
               semao:RiCCMCorrespondingComponent annotation.</rdf:value>
